   "id": null,
   "title": "Exterior design",
   "intro": "The Antares 7 proudly displays a vigorous, dynamic style.\nIts taut, clean lines confer a sporty allure, like the rubbing strake that gives the boat its lean, elegant silhouette. This new unit asserts its own character while retaining the characteristic features of the Antares range. Its cockpit, slightly offset to port, offers a wide gangway to starboard that facilitates access to the forward sunpad.",
