   "id": null,
   "title": "Interior Design",
   "intro": "The care taken in designing the Antares 7 silhouette follows into the saloon, which has a particularly attractive helm station. Fitted with an all-black dashboard in a single piece, it elegantly compliments the boat's overall finish. The many glazed windows and ventilation openings offer all passengers superb panoramic views and excellent aeration. The cabin's numerous storage spaces and modularity make for a very comfortable life on board.",
