   "items": [
    {
     "title": "STARBOARD SIDE GATE",
     "text": "The starboard side gate makes docking even easier, while creating an additional, safe access to the sea for swimming or hauling fish in."
    },
    {
     "title": "VAST U-SHAPED COCKPIT",
     "text": "The cockpit can comfortably seat up to 5 people. All the seats, and the large folding table, can be converted into a spacious sunpad."
    },
    {
     "title": "COMFORTABLE SALOON",
     "text": "The Antares 7 saloon offers outstanding comfort. Modularity is enhanced by a swivelling pilot's seat, and a co-pilot benchseat that tilts in an instant to face the second benchseat, or to create a berth. The galley area is located behind the pilot's seat."
    }
